// Note to translators:
// If a sentence is the same in your language then please change it to "#same"
//
// eg:
// LANG_ENGLISH  "HALT"
// LANG_GERMAN   "#same"
//
// (This is so we can tell which strings have been signed-off as ok to be the same words for QA
//  and because we do not store duplicate strings, which will then get exported again next time
//  as being untranslated.)
//
VERSION             "1"
CONFIG              "W:\bin\stringed.cfg"
FILENOTES           "Siege specific strings"

REFERENCE           HEALTH
LANG_ENGLISH        "HEALTH:"

REFERENCE           SHIELDS
LANG_ENGLISH        "SHIELDS:"

REFERENCE           SPEED
LANG_ENGLISH        "SPEED:"

REFERENCE           DEMO_IMP_DEMO
LANG_ENGLISH        "Imperial Demolitionist: The demolitionist is average in combat, but is an expert at laying traps and taking out large objectives."

REFERENCE           DEMO_MERC_DEMO
LANG_ENGLISH        "Mercenary Demolitionist:  The demolitionist is average in combat, but is an expert at laying traps and taking out large objectives."

REFERENCE           DEMO_REBEL_DEMO
LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Demolitionist: The demolitionist is average in combat, but is an expert at laying traps and taking out large objectives."

REFERENCE           HVY_DJEDI_DESTROYER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Jedi Destroyer: This heavy weapons is well trained in dark Force powers, utilizing many different powers, but mastering none.  Although he carries a saber, he prefers the destructive nature of his powers over his blade."

REFERENCE           HVY_MERC_SPECIALIST
LANG_ENGLISH        "Mercenary Heavy Weapons Specialist: This heavy weapons member is slow, but makes up for it with sheer firepower."

REFERENCE           HVY_REBEL_SPECIALIST
LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Heavy Weapons Specialist:  This heavy weapons member is slow, but is heavily armed, dealing out great amounts of damage."

REFERENCE           INF_CULTIST
LANG_ENGLISH        "Cultist:  This infantry member has a number of low level Force abilities but is untrained in the ways of the dark Jedi."

REFERENCE           INF_JEDI_HUNTER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Jedi Hunter:  This infantry member is a specialist is neutralizing Jedi.  The Ysalimiri protects him against the Force while the flechette gun is an excellent anti-lightsaber weapon at close range."

REFERENCE           INF_LIGHT_FORCE_ADVENTURER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Light Force Adventurer:  This infantry member has a number of low level Force abilities but is untrained in the ways of the Jedi."

REFERENCE           INF_MERCENARY
LANG_ENGLISH        "Mercenary:  This member of the Mercenary infantry is good at both offensive and defensive combat and can hold his own against most forces."

REFERENCE           INF_PROTECTOR
LANG_ENGLISH        "Protector: Enlisted by the Jedi to protect Force-sensitive areas, this well-armed infantry member can make a difference in any battle."

REFERENCE           INF_REBEL_ASSAULT
LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Assault Specialist: This assault member is moderately equipped, but can take take a large amount of damage."

REFERENCE           INF_REBEL_INFANTRY
LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Infantry: This member of the infantry is trained and equipped for defensive combat; laying down tripmines to slow the enemy down."

REFERENCE           INF_SNOWTROOPER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Snowtrooper:  This member of the infantry is specially trained and equipped for lightning attacks against heavy defenses."

REFERENCE           JEDI_DJEDI_DUELIST
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Jedi Duelist:  This Dark Jedi has scant offensive or defensive Force powers but is unequaled in the art of combat with two lightsabers.\n"

REFERENCE           JEDI_DJEDI_KNIGHT
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Jedi Knight: The Dark Jedi Knight is trained in both the lightsaber and dark side of the Force, creating a well-balanced combatant with equal parts strength and weakness.\n"

REFERENCE           JEDI_DJEDI_MARAUDER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Side Maurauder: This Dark Jedi has a moderate range of offensive and defensive Force powers but is unequaled in the art of combat with the arcane double-bladed lightsaber."

REFERENCE           JEDI_JEDI_DUELIST
LANG_ENGLISH        "Jedi Duelist:  This Jedi has moderate offensive and defensive Force powers but is unequaled in the art of combat with two lightsabers.\n"

REFERENCE           JEDI_JEDI_GUARDIAN
LANG_ENGLISH        "Jedi Guardian: This Jedi has scant offensive or defensive Force powers but is unequaled in the art of combat with the arcane double-bladed lightsaber."

REFERENCE           JEDI_JEDI_KNIGHT
LANG_ENGLISH        "Jedi Knight: The Jedi Knight is trained in both the lightsaber and light side of the Force, creating a well-balanced combatant with equal parts strength and weakness."

REFERENCE           SUPP_IMP_SUPPLIER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Imperial Supply:  This support member keeps the other troops healthy and able to fight by providing them with necessary supplies in the field."

REFERENCE           SUPP_IMP_TECH
NOTES               "Keep within the character limit of this string.  It uses up all the available area in English."
LANG_ENGLISH        "Imperial Tech:  The tech can break the defenses of the enemy by hacking their doors and computer systems, or by a more direct approach with the DEMP2 gun.  The tech can also dispense ammo if no one is near, resupply allies when they are near, and repair certain objects and objectives (all via the 'use' key)."

REFERENCE           SUPP_JEDI_HEALER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Jedi Healer: This support member has great interest in saving lives.  The Healer can move quickly and stealthily in order to heal her teammates."

REFERENCE           SUPP_REBEL_SUPPLY
LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Supplier:  This support member keeps the other troops healthy and able to fight by providing them with necessary supplies in the field."

REFERENCE           SUPP_REBEL_TECH
NOTES               "Keep within the character limit of this string.  It uses up all the available area in English."
LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Tech:  The tech can break the defenses of the enemy by hacking their doors and computer systems, or by a more direct approach with the DEMP2 gun.  The tech can also dispense ammo if no one is near, resupply allies when they are near, and repair certain objects and objectives (all via the 'use' key)."

REFERENCE           SUPP_SMUGGLER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Mercenary Tech:  This Chiss support member can help defend choke points.  The tech can also dispense ammo canisters if no one is near, resupply allies when they are near, and repair certain objects and objectives (all via the 'use' key)."

REFERENCE           VAN_BOUNTY_HUNTER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Bounty Hunter:  This Rodian assault member is moderately equipped, but can take take a large amount of damage."

REFERENCE           VAN_DFORCE_ASSASSIN
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Force Assassin: This vanguard member is physically weaker than other team members and has limited Force ability, yet is an expert marksman who is deadly in his own right."

REFERENCE           VAN_DJEDI_INVADER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Jedi Invader:  This dark Jedi is physically weaker than other team members, but uses his speed and stealth abilities to achieve his objectives."

REFERENCE           VAN_IMP_SNIPER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Imperial Sniper:  This scout member is light on equipment, but is an expert marksman who can get to a vantage point quickly and fortify his position with a portable sentry gun."

