LANG_ENGLISH        "Rebel Sniper: This scout member is an expert marksman who can quickly get in place unseen."

REFERENCE           VAN_ROCKETTROOPER
LANG_ENGLISH        "Imperial Heavy Weapons Specialist: This heavy weapons member is slow, but makes up for it with sheer firepower."

