REFERENCE           INF_JEDI_WARRIOR
LANG_ENGLISH        "Jedi Warrior: Trained in the art of double-bladed lightsaber combat, his kicks can surprise enemy lightsaber duelists.  This Jedi is also trained to use Force Absorb and Force Protect.  "

