REFERENCE           DEMO_DJEDI_DEMO
LANG_ENGLISH        "Dark Jedi Demolitionist: This Dark Jedi has been instructed in the ways of the single lightsaber strong combat style and the use of explosives."

REFERENCE           SUPP_DJEDI_TECH
